00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:46,320
You can only live your
life, not someone else's.

256
00:15:47,600 --> 00:15:48,659
Yes, you're right.

257
00:15:52,420 --> 00:15:53,680
I should get going.

258
00:15:56,940 --> 00:16:01,587
Say, did Eugeo happen to tell you why
the Integrity Knight took my sister away?

259
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:04,300
Um, yeah, he did.

260
00:16:04,540 --> 00:16:08,260
My parents wouldn't tell me, and
Eugeo wouldn't tell me either.

261
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:11,100
Maybe you could tell me why?

262
00:16:11,920 --> 00:16:12,757
Yeah, sure.

263
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:17,664
She went to the End Mountains, then touched
the ground on the Dark Territory side.

264
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:19,310
I see.

265
00:16:19,640 --> 00:16:21,020
The End Mountains, huh?

266
00:16:25,060 --> 00:16:26,648
Tomorrow's our day of rest.

267
00:16:26,860 --> 00:16:27,919
Still, be on time.

268
00:16:28,060 --> 00:16:30,457
I won't be coming to wake you up anymore.

269
00:16:30,540 --> 00:16:32,246
Okay, I'll keep that in mind.

270
00:16:48,740 --> 00:16:49,780
Good morning.

271
00:16:51,160 --> 00:16:53,920
Oh, good morning. By chance.

272
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:56,600
Have you seen Selka today? No.

273
00:16:56,900 --> 00:16:58,371
I just woke up, actually.

274
00:16:58,740 --> 00:16:59,620
So I see.

275
00:16:59,980 --> 00:17:02,215
Well, I have not seen her all morning.

276
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:05,480
She missed prayers, and
she is not in her room.

277
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:09,560
I am worried she would never
leave without telling me first.

278
00:17:09,800 --> 00:17:11,094
I'm sure she's around.

279
00:17:11,380 --> 00:17:12,260
I hope so.

280
00:17:12,540 --> 00:17:15,580
If you see her, please
let me know. Yes, ma 'am.

281
00:17:18,380 --> 00:17:19,900
Yujiu! Hey, Kirito.

282
00:17:20,160 --> 00:17:21,866
Have you seen Selka anywhere?

283
00:17:22,060 --> 00:17:23,380
I haven't. Why?

284
00:17:24,120 --> 00:17:26,296
Sister Azalea's been looking for her.

285
00:17:26,500 --> 00:17:28,597
She says she left without telling her.

286
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:29,562
That's strange.

287
00:17:29,880 --> 00:17:31,277
Well, I'm trying to find her.

288
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:32,837
Do you know where she could have gone?

289
00:17:32,920 --> 00:17:35,220
No, she and I haven't spoken in ages.

290
00:17:35,760 --> 00:17:38,348
Do you think something
might have upset her?

291
00:17:40,220 --> 00:17:41,100
I see.

292
00:17:41,540 --> 00:17:42,893
The End Mountains, huh?

293
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:47,317
Man, last night I told her
what happened to Alice.

294
00:17:47,400 --> 00:17:50,106
At least everything you
told me that happened.

295
00:17:50,980 --> 00:17:54,451
She wouldn't go to the Yen
Mountains on her own, would she?

296
00:17:54,860 --> 00:17:56,477
That's exactly where she went!

297
00:17:56,560 --> 00:17:58,325
We have to bring her back now!

298
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:07,270
What's wrong?

299
00:18:08,040 --> 00:18:09,275
It's been stepped on.

300
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:17,420
It's lost a bit of life someone's been
by here and it wasn't that long ago.

301
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:21,353
Then we're on the right track
that's gotta be Selka yeah.

302
00:18:26,760 --> 00:18:28,120
Well this is it.

303
00:18:29,980 --> 00:18:36,640
No way it really is the end when I first
came here I thought the same thing?

304
00:18:37,960 --> 00:18:41,320
And the Dark Territory's
down that way, huh? Yeah.

305
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:42,560
Are you ready?

306
00:18:42,860 --> 00:18:44,740
Yeah, I think. I guess.

307
00:18:46,880 --> 00:18:47,837
System call.

308
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:50,180
Generate luminous elements. Adhere.

309
00:18:52,660 --> 00:18:54,080
Eugeo, what'd you do?

310
00:18:54,280 --> 00:18:55,600
It's a sacred art.

311
00:18:55,760 --> 00:18:57,642
An easy one that anybody can do.

312
00:18:57,740 --> 00:18:59,660
But, like, you said system.

313
00:18:59,860 --> 00:19:01,297
Do you even know what that means?

314
00:19:01,380 --> 00:19:02,210
Nothing.

315
00:19:02,293 --> 00:19:03,220
It's just a word.

316
00:19:03,500 --> 00:19:04,441
Well, a command.

317
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:06,391
It's to call on the gods.

318
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:10,217
As long as you have enough skill, you'll
be blessed with the art you summon.

319
00:19:10,300 --> 00:19:12,580
He thinks he's casting a magic spell.

320
00:19:13,840 --> 00:19:15,640
Come on, let's go. Right.

321
00:19:23,420 --> 00:19:25,200
Maybe she didn't come in here.

322
00:19:25,460 --> 00:19:27,284
I mean, there's no sign of her.

323
00:19:31,420 --> 00:19:33,177
This is as good a sign as any.

324
00:19:33,260 --> 00:19:35,300
It could be her, I guess.

325
00:19:39,500 --> 00:19:41,400
Hey, Yujiya. What is it?

326
00:19:41,860 --> 00:19:44,097
If she crosses into the Dark Territory,

327
00:19:44,180 --> 00:19:47,197
does an Integrity Knight
come and take her right away?

328
00:19:47,280 --> 00:19:49,200
No, not until the next day.

329
00:19:49,780 --> 00:19:53,960
He'll fly to the village and arrest
her there, just like six years ago.

330
00:19:54,360 --> 00:19:59,184
Then, even if we're too late, we still
have a chance to keep him from getting her.

331
00:20:00,140 --> 00:20:01,717
But that would be interfering.

332
00:20:01,800 --> 00:20:02,760
We can't.

333
00:20:03,260 --> 00:20:04,480
Of course we can.

334
00:20:04,940 --> 00:20:07,587
Look, even if she does
break the taboo index,

335
00:20:07,780 --> 00:20:10,137
all we have to do is keep
her away from the village.

336
00:20:10,220 --> 00:20:13,457
The Integrity Knight can't
arrest her if he can't find her.

337
00:20:13,540 --> 00:20:14,540
That's insane.

338
00:20:15,260 --> 00:20:16,780
We can't hide forever.

339
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:18,620
And I have my calling.

340
00:20:18,820 --> 00:20:20,938
But I don't, so I can take her away.

341
00:20:22,240 --> 00:20:25,217
If I didn't say anything,
she wouldn't be in this mess.

342
00:20:25,300 --> 00:20:26,380
This is all on me.

343
00:20:27,140 --> 00:20:28,280
No, it's not.

344
00:20:30,280 --> 00:20:31,110
Sugou!

345
00:20:34,160 --> 00:20:35,720
That way!

346
00:20:43,260 --> 00:20:44,090
Take cover!

347
00:20:59,060 --> 00:21:00,420
Crap!

348
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:01,700
Goblins!

349
00:21:03,260 --> 00:21:05,120
Me, I'm sorry.

350
00:21:11,580 --> 00:21:12,410
Sugou!

351
00:21:12,660 --> 00:21:13,800
What are you doing?

352
00:21:21,760 --> 00:21:23,140
Yuki-yuki.

353
00:21:23,480 --> 00:21:28,220
Two more white eon-brassy brats
just a-wondering around. Yummy.

354
00:21:28,620 --> 00:21:30,297
Let's tie him to the other one.

355
00:21:30,380 --> 00:21:31,740
Ha ha ha ha!

356
00:21:32,600 --> 00:21:33,430
Silence!

357
00:21:34,140 --> 00:21:36,160
They're male youths.

358
00:21:36,360 --> 00:21:38,880
We take them back, no one buy them.

359
00:21:39,440 --> 00:21:40,270
Worthless.

360
00:21:40,360 --> 00:21:42,620
Kill them and make them meat instead.

361
00:21:45,540 --> 00:21:58,870
Eugeo!

362
00:22:01,520 --> 00:22:02,350
Yojiro!

363
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:25,540
If you want to see the sun,
I'll see you in the morning.

364
00:23:35,600 --> 00:23:38,080
Next time, Departure.
